### ── V1 REQUESTS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Response shape: { id, userId, title, body }
# 'title' is a single full string

### V1 - Get all posts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/1/blog-posts

### V1 - Get one post
GET http://localhost:8080/api/1/blog-posts/1

### V1 - Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/1/blog-posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Four Demo",
  "body": "Testing V1 from .http file",
  "userId": 1
}

### V1 - Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/1/blog-posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title Here",
  "body": "Updated from IntelliJ",
  "userId": 1
}

### V1 - Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/1/blog-posts/1

### ── V2 REQUESTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Breaking change: 'title' is split into 'shortTitle' + 'titleDetails'


### V2 - Get all posts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/2/blog-posts

### V2 - Get one post
GET http://localhost:8080/api/2/blog-posts/1

### V2 - Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/2/blog-posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Four Demo",
  "body": "Testing V2 from .http file",
  "userId": 1
}

### V2 - Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/2/blog-posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title Here",
  "body": "Updated from IntelliJ V2",
  "userId": 1
}

### V2 - Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/2/blog-posts/1

### ── INVALID VERSION (should be rejected) ──────────────────────────────────

### Invalid version — Spring Boot 4 rejects with proper error response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/3/blog-posts

### ── MANUAL VERSIONING COMPARISON ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Old approach — version hardcoded in URL path, no central config

### Manual V1 - Get all posts
GET http://localhost:8080/manual/v1/blog-posts

### Manual V2 - Get all posts (breaking change: shortTitle + titleDetails)
GET http://localhost:8080/manual/v2/blog-posts

### Manual unknown version — returns 404 (no handler found)
### Compare: Spring Boot 4 returns a proper versioning error instead
GET http://localhost:8080/manual/v99/blog-posts

